Package: dde-dock-hwmonitor
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dde-shell (>= 2.0), libdde-shell (>= 2.0),
         libdtk6core, libdtk6gui
Maintainer: HwMonitor contributors <hwmonitor@example.com>
Description: DDE Dock hardware monitor plugin
 A dde-shell plugin that shows hardware info directly in the Deepin/UOS
 Dock: CPU/GPU/VRAM/memory usage, CPU/GPU temperature and independent
 upload/download speeds.
 Click the monitor text to open the settings panel (show/hide items,
 ordering, single/double line, custom colors, font and per-item width).
